    "intro_narrative": "The rain lashes against the foggy windows of your rundown detective agency. You've just received a mysterious anonymous package containing a collection of legacy tech and encrypted data fragments. The note attached is brief: 'They're covering up the syndicate's latest hit. Only you can piece this together.' Before you is a chaotic web of outdated extraction tools, corrupted drives, and cipher machines. Your objective is clear: navigate this labyrinth of digital evidence, route the fragmented data through the correct analysis tools, and reconstruct the final truth. You'll need to power up the main terminal to reveal the syndicate's secrets, but it's locked behind multiple layers of cryptographic dependencies. Time is running out before the trail goes completely cold. Connect the dots, Detective.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
